        "body": "> v1.1.0 is the next minor release.\n>\n> **Timetable**: to be announced.\n\n## 👉 Changelog\n\n### 🚀 Enhancements\n\n- first pass at @nodevu/opt (#79)\n- add @nodevu/fetchindex (#78)\n- introduce oldest, deprecate earliest (#77)\n- add @nodevu/latest module (#76)\n- update data (#58)\n- update data (#57)\n- update data (#55)\n- update data (#49)\n- update data (#48)\n- update data (#47)\n- update data (#44)\n- update data (#41)\n- update data (#39)\n- add release date and modules version (#32)\n- add @nodevu/translate (#27)\n- update data (#31)\n- update data (#30)\n- update data (#29)\n- update data (#20)\n- update data (#19)\n- update data (#18)\n- update data (#17)\n- update data (#16)\n- update data (#12)\n- update data (#11)\n- add new data (#10)\n- add custom index and schedule options ([`1e0de66`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/1e0de66))\n- add aliases package ([`6e377ac`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/6e377ac))\n- add ranges ([`a784259`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/a784259))\n- add earliest ([`88e2056`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/88e2056))\n- add 'oldest' to security data ([`05096f2`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/05096f2))\n- begin work on earliest ([`3cf4b06`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/3cf4b06))\n- support architectures ([`1661cbe`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/1661cbe))\n- add static ([`4aee41a`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/4aee41a))\n- core improvements around files and releases ([`f3561fc`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/f3561fc))\n\n### 🩹 Fixes\n\n- add missing property to files in @nodevu/core and fix all tests (#73)\n- linter issues (#69)\n- remove async wrapper around static builders (#54)\n- improve logic in ranges and fix missing test requires (#36)\n- small tweaks to normalzie writing files (#22)\n- run lint:fix ([`e4927ef`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/e4927ef))\n- fixes a bug with options assignment ([`99c4216`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/99c4216))\n- update package-lock.json ([`5efab76`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/5efab76))\n- correctly place misplaced line ([`70b10dd`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/70b10dd))\n- make sunos return correct files ([`4992bbf`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/4992bbf))\n- add missing files ([`44c36ff`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/44c36ff))\n- add missing const ([`537f22b`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/537f22b))\n- run standard --fix ([`472cd30`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/472cd30))\n- update static package name ([`191be75`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/191be75))\n- security releases are actually correct now ([`57a629c`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/57a629c))\n\n### 🏡 Chore\n\n- update + bump earliest and ranges (#75)\n- @nodevu/0.3.0 release (#74)\n- update dependencies and tooling in all packages (#67)\n- 0.2.0 ([`fc8f5c2`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/fc8f5c2))\n- update deps in @nodevu/core (#65)\n- update static dependencies (#62)\n- use tabs rather than spaces to be consistent with linter (#61)\n- drop undici (#60)\n- update @nodevu/core version ([`0c8538c`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/0c8538c))\n- release updates (#38)\n- tweaks to translate (#37)\n- update tooling for updates (#35)\n- further YAML tweaks ([`c23c4c1`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/c23c4c1))\n- **root:** normalize scripts ([`f6504dc`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/f6504dc))\n- **static:** update to build prepublish ([`85530b4`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/85530b4))\n- **static:** update data ([`a37296b`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/a37296b))\n- remove package-lock.json ([`996679f`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/996679f))\n- simplify slightly for clarity ([`68d6478`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/68d6478))\n- deps update ([`d9c1a31`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/d9c1a31))\n- package-lock.json updates ([`e3c1491`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/e3c1491))\n- some WIP core test updates ([`cc64d6d`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/cc64d6d))\n- update undici ([`e32bdbb`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/e32bdbb))\n- bump versions ([`32be306`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/32be306))\n- remove useless colon ([`bb30fe6`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/bb30fe6))\n- tweak readme further ([`2bf98ea`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/2bf98ea))\n- update files to remove useless files from publish ([`cb87e8f`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/cb87e8f))\n- fix typo ([`3c8057f`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/3c8057f))\n- update main README ([`c3f6ba8`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/c3f6ba8))\n- reorder deps ([`15c9654`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/15c9654))\n- add nock (missing from last commit) ([`9afb864`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/9afb864))\n- add foundations for low-maintenance data mocking ([`19d603c`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/19d603c))\n- add LICENSE to all package.json files ([`7bf59c7`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/7bf59c7))\n- add license files to all packages ([`0d6c38a`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/0d6c38a))\n- add files to parsefiles ([`eab3445`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/eab3445))\n- fix earliest package name and add files ([`d6b9f5a`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/d6b9f5a))\n- add coverage script ([`d33cabb`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/d33cabb))\n- add mocha as test command ([`56129b9`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/56129b9))\n- add missing lint scripts ([`8cee631`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/8cee631))\n- version 0.0.3 ([`31ac3b6`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/31ac3b6))\n- version 0.0.2 ([`dabea26`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/dab