[`4406fdd`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/4406fdd))\n- update releases ([`4bb929d`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/4bb929d))\n- add releases data support ([`0b44cdf`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/0b44cdf))\n- add github action to do nightly builds ([`1047131`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/1047131))\n- add all releases files ([`1713318`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/1713318))\n- add all basic files ([`5775a4a`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/5775a4a))\n- add gitignore ([`8e8dfbe`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/8e8dfbe))\n- rename ([`2cb50b6`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/2cb50b6))\n- initial commit ([`9295515`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/9295515))\n\n### ✅ Tests\n\n- update tests-core.yml to check that there aren't needed updates (#82)\n- update test data (#83)\n- switch to Biome (#46)\n- regenerate test data and fix values (#34)\n- further ranges improvements (#26)\n- add more static releases checks (#24)\n- improve core tests and add static tests (#21)\n- add more passing tests (#15)\n- **core:** move core to Node.js's test library (#13)\n- lint and lint:fix everywhere ([`de7afb0`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/de7afb0))\n- setup lint for all modules ([`6309bd7`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/6309bd7))\n- add tests for custom index and schedule ([`ab08e41`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/ab08e41))\n- remove unused dynamic test code ([`481487c`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/481487c))\n- remove code we'll never hit ([`d3fe313`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/d3fe313))\n- make static tests work ([`66e63a3`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/66e63a3))\n- minor tweaks ([`38d46be`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/38d46be))\n- remove useless options ([`ec546e2`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/ec546e2))\n- update tests to maybe halfway work ([`f5c39d4`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/f5c39d4))\n- some WIP changes that I thought I committed ([`33e3bd3`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/33e3bd3))\n- add core tests ([`7f53acc`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/7f53acc))\n- add parsefiles test ([`fe8c145`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/fe8c145))\n- update linting ignores ([`562dc49`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/562dc49))\n- add tape ([`bc837fd`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/bc837fd))\n\n### 🤖 CI\n\n- add uppt release flow (#84)\n- make everything consistent (#80)\n- update CI actions to setup-node@v4 (#68)\n- add automated publishing for core and static (#63)\n- add \"workflow_call:\" to all linter and test Actions (#56)\n- add formatter step to nightly static build (#52)\n- add, update, and improve Actions for linting and CI (#45)\n- update core test suite to use correct globbing ([`7c0987a`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/7c0987a))\n- try a different paths value (#23)\n- update linter name ([`6cf1b78`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/6cf1b78))\n- small @nodevu/core fixes ([`457029f`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/457029f))\n- add GitHub Actions CI for @nodevu/core ([`d1e6597`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/d1e6597))\n- update new data commit message and title ([`5eda3b5`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/5eda3b5))\n- add install step ([`33ceb69`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/33ceb69))\n- fix with statement ([`9e4e8d8`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/9e4e8d8))\n- fix yaml ([`4a8b240`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/4a8b240))\n- automation updates ([`7a43f20`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/7a43f20))\n- update parsefiles cjs scripts ([`637c6c1`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/637c6c1))\n- add build scripts to static ([`234e8f9`](https://github.com/cutenode/nodevu/commit/234e8f9))\n\n### 🎉 New Contributors\n\n- Tierney Cyren (@bnb)\n- Claudio W (@ovflowd)\n- github-actions[bot] (@github-actions[bot])\n- Shiba (@HinataKah0)\n\n### ❤️ Contributors\n\n- Tierney Cyren (@bnb)\n- Claudio W (@ovflowd)\n- github-actions[bot] (@github-actions[bot])\n- Shiba (@HinataKah0)",
